	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salve, mi charissime et venerande <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Scribit noster senatus <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>vestro in caussa <persName ref="p4225">Michaelis Backii</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Das Schreiben vom 15. November findet sich in <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> SIA. A 205. 1, Nr. 179 (Entwurf: Stadtarchiv Konstanz, B II 38, 90); eine Antwort ist nicht erhalten.</note>, qui superioribus annis mihi <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>a vobis commendatus in ducatu <placeName ref="l572">Wirtempergensi</placeName> <placeName ref="l1804">Tusslingensis</placeName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><placeName ref="l1804">Dußlingen</placeName> (<placeName ref="l3586">Kr. Tübingen</placeName>, <placeName ref="l572">Baden-Württemberg</placeName>).</note> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ecclesię <placeName ref="l512">Tubingensis</placeName> agri episcopus designatus fuit, ubi sana doctrina <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>et inculpatę vitę innocentia gregem Christi magna felicitate pavit <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tantisper, dum calumniator et, qui homicida fuit ab initio<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">der Teufel (vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Joh 8, 44)</ref></cit>.</note>, miris <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>artibus effecit, ut<pb type="edition" next="189"/> proscriberetur ob causam, qua nunquam cecidisset, si vel <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>apud vos vel nos aut alios quoslibet evangelii studiosos iure experiri <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>licuisset.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nunc hic forte in locum<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">locum <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> demortui <persName ref="p6968">parochi</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p6968">Leonhard Walder</persName>, Leutpriester zu St. Paul; s. Hans-Christoph <hi>Rublack,</hi> Die Einführung der Reformation in Konstanz von den Anfängen bis zum Abschluß 1531, Gütersloh-Karlsruhe 1971. - <bibl source="b518">QFRG</bibl> XL, S. 160f, Nr. 46.</note> apud divi <persName ref="p19981">Pauli</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>templum reciperetur, ni quidam execranda acti invidia sparsissent ipsum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>apud vos quoque talia designasse, ut urbe vestra et agro sibi sit interdictum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Id quod quum certo certius sciam vanum esse, visum tamen senatui est, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ut de hac re a vestris quamprimum reddatur certior.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Rogo igitur te, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ut bonę huic caussę bonus et ęquus adsis tuisque senatoribus, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>quos magis familiares habes, author sis, ut testimonium idque <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>plenum ferant innocentię, quo nomine et deo optimo maximo <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>valde gratificabuntur et nostris pariter et nobis rem facient longe <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>gratissimam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Scripsi non pridem <persName ref="p1753">Leoni</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p8055">Blarers</persName> Brief an <persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName> ist nicht erhalten.</note>, nec quicquam nunc est, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>quod scire vos mareferat, nisi quod <persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName> heri <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ad me datis literis<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> an <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName>, 9. November 1540 (<persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> BW II 591, <ref target="file10926">Nr. 885</ref>). Auf dem Brief ist als Empfangsdatum der 15. November vermerkt.</note> inter cętera ita scribit: „Divinare non possum, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>quid adversarii agere nobiscum instituant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Tales enim adsunt, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>a quibus nihil expectes Christi, ut a <persName ref="p19981">pontifice</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Papst <persName ref="p19981">Paul III.</persName></note>, <persName ref="p18477">rege</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">König <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinand I.</persName></note>, <placeName ref="l619">Bavaris</placeName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p18549">Ludwig X.</persName> und <persName ref="p18604">Wilhelm IV.</persName>, Herzöge von <placeName ref="l619">Bayern</placeName>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/><persName ref="p20531">Moguntino</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p20531">Albrecht von Brandenburg</persName>, Erzbischof und Kurfürst von <placeName ref="l307">Mainz</placeName>.</note> et <persName ref="p7572">Argentoratensi</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p7572">Wilhelm von Honstein</persName>, Bischof von <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Contra <persName ref="p18548">Palatinus</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p18548">Ludwig V.</persName>, Kurfürst von der <placeName ref="l2477">Pfalz</placeName>.</note> designavit, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><persName ref="p18520">marchio</persName> <placeName ref="l1048">Brandenburgensis</placeName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p18520">Joachim II.</persName>, Markgraf und Kurfürst von <placeName ref="l1048">Brandenburg</placeName>.</note>, <persName ref="p8462">Coloniensis</persName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><persName ref="p8462">Hermann von Wied</persName>, Erzbischof und Kurfürst von <placeName ref="l267">Köln</placeName>.</note>, <persName ref="p18605">Iuliacensis</persName><note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Herzog <persName ref="p18605">Wilhelm von Jülich, Berg und Kleve</persName>.</note> miserunt, a quibus <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>impetres, quod ęquum sit<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Vgl. unten <ref target="file11484">Nr. 1441</ref>, 14-21.</note>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ego divinare nihil possum.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Nostr<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>i ad unum consentiunt, ut nihil remittatur, quod per se Christi est.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Papę <persName ref="p18362">nuncius</persName><note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Päpstlicher Nuntius für das <placeName ref="l569">Wormser</placeName> Religionsgespräch war <persName ref="p18362">Tommaso Campeggi</persName>; vgl. <bibl source="b477">Pastor</bibl> V 284.</note> iactat se mandata habere, ut omnia nobis concedat, quę <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>habemus, tantum ut ipsum invicem agnoscamus et praedicemus <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>principem summum ecclesię, id est apud nos iuxta Christum collocemus, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>in aliis ecclesiis patiamur depulso Christo in sede Christi ipsa <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>eum adorari.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">A <placeName ref="l822">Germanis</placeName> aliquid accessionis expectandum erat, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ideo hostes istum iniquissimum delectum fecerunt, ne status omnes <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>adsint<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Gemeint ist die im Abschied von <placeName ref="l199">Hagenau</placeName> festgeschriebene Beschränkung auf je 11 Stimmen für beide Parteien; vgl. <bibl source="b62">ADRG</bibl> I/1 154, 17-26.</note>; sed hoc boni est, quod hic nihil concluditur“ etc.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Hęc <persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName>.<pb type="edition" next="190"/></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Inter <persName ref="p18538">cęsarem</persName><note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">Kaiser <persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> et <persName ref="p20225">Gallum</persName><note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20"><persName ref="p20225">Franz I.</persName>, König von <placeName ref="l832">Frankreich</placeName>.</note> suborta sunt nova bellorum seminaria, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>quę pontifex summo conatu tollere constantissime pergit.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Ita <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>noster legatus <persName ref="p5741">Ioachimus</persName><note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">Ita ... Ioachimus <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note><note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21"><persName ref="p5741">Joachim Maler</persName>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Pax inter <persName ref="p18593">Turcam</persName> et <placeName ref="l522">Venetos</placeName><note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22">Der Friedensvertrag zwischen Sultan <persName ref="p18593">Suleiman I.</persName> und <placeName ref="l522">Venedig</placeName> war nach längeren Verhandlungen am 2. Oktober ratifiziert worden; s. <bibl source="b152">Cardauns</bibl> 37-39.</note> ita confirmabitur, ut cessura sit <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>in magnum christiani orbis detrimentum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><pb type="scan" next="350"/><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Tu ad me fac diligenter perscribas, quid vestri parturiant <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><placeName ref="l862">Helvetii</placeName>; varia enim et dubia spargit perpetuus rumor<note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23">Vgl. oben <ref target="file11468">Nr. 1425</ref>, Anm. 16.</note>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Nos dominum inter istos turbines et motus rerum obnixe precabimur, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ut ecclesię suę tranquillitatem et pacem in seipso propicius <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>largiatur et eum spiritum impertiat, qui ad solidam resipiscentiam <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>extimulet resides nos et pertinacissime veteri adhęrentes luto.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Inprimis me meosque domino christianice semper commenda <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>cum coniuge<note xml:id="fn24" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="24"><persName ref="p8051">Anna, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note> tua et fratribus.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><placeName ref="l822">Germanus</placeName> frater meus <persName ref="p8178">Thomas</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>cum <persName ref="p4079">Zvicciis</persName><note xml:id="fn25" type="footnote" n="25">Johannes und <persName ref="p4082">Konrad Zwick</persName>.</note> plurimam tibi salutem adscribere iubent teque <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>hoc ipsum, quod ego, in <persName ref="p4225">Mihaelis</persName> caussa obsecrant et obtestantur<note xml:id="fn26" type="footnote" n="26">Vgl. die Briefe <persName ref="p8178">Thomas Blarer</persName>s und <persName ref="p4079">Johannes Zwicks</persName> vom Vortag, oben <ref target="file11476">Nr. 1433</ref>, 14, bzw. 1434, 27-29.</note>.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z11"/>Tuam sororem<note xml:id="fn27" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="27"><persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> scheint irrtümlich anzunehmen, daß <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> eine Schwester hatte; wahrscheinlich handelt es sich aber eher um eine versehentlich nicht gestrichene Verschreibung.</note>, <persName ref="p4321">uxorem</persName> mearum<note xml:id="fn28" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="28">Gemeint sind <persName ref="p8055">Blarers</persName> Ehefrau <persName ref="p4321">Katharina, geb. Ryff</persName>, und seine Schwester <persName ref="p4334">Margaretha</persName>.</note> verbis multum iubebis salvere.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p2z12"/>Iterum iterumque vale, mi charissime et optime simulatque venerande anime<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>vielleicht als</hi> autem <hi>zu lesen.</hi></note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z13"/>Constantię, 17. novembris anno 1540.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z14"/>Ignosce tumultuario et plusquam insubido scripto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8055">Ambr. Blaur.</persName></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf S. 352:]</note>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Bullingero</persName> <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>suo venerando <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>atque ch<lb xml:id="p4z4"/>arissim<lb xml:id="p4z5"/>o.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
